<p>
    This incident is shown because of {{ incident.getFailureEventsCount() }} outgoing email failures between
    {{ incident.getDateFirstFailure()|date }} and {{ incident.getDateLastFailure()|date }}
</p>

<p>
    To solve the issue navigate to the
    <a href="/admin/#/tickets/ticket_accounts/{{ incident.getEmailAccountId() }}" target="_blank">
        Tickets &rarr; Email Accounts (will be opened in a new tab)
    </a>
    and check account settings.
</p>

<p>
    Make sure credentials are correct by pressing the Test Account Settings button and verifying its' success report.
</p>

<p>
    If your credentials are correct and you still see this incident, check network between your DeskPRO
    instance host and email server and make sure the email server is up and available.
</p>

<p>
    Once incoming email process succeeds, this incident will get resolved automatically.
</p>
